{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"main_15_level_main_15-15_end_variation01","storyGroup":"main_15","storySort":230,"storyDependence":"main_15_level_main_15-15_end_variation01","storyCanShow":0,"storyCode":"15-17","storyName":"“她”","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"在对抗普瑞赛斯的过程中，博士、凯尔希和阿米娅竭尽全力。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"obt/main/level_main_15-15_end_variation01","avgTag":"幕间","unLockType":"STAGE_CLEAR","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"main_15-15","minState":"PLAYED","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":18,"next":20,"characters":["普瑞赛斯","预言家","Mon3tr","凯尔希","阿米娅","Mechanist","Logos","煌","Raidian","阿斯卡纶","？？？"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_bg_60_g2_rhodeslivingroom_bc.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":6},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":7},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/avg/m_avg_calm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":8,"musicid":0},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":9},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_openftstpwalk","id":10},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":11},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#2$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":12},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"你看上去有些低落，{@nickname}。","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"是什么原因呢？愿意与我分享吗？","id":15,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1360_1#1$1","id":16},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"QHU9112，又一个褪色的星系。","id":17,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"这是新一轮的涨潮，波及我们周围的仅仅是第一波前浪，祂的到来比我们预算的还要快一些。","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"我们的时间不多了......","id":19,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#1$1","id":20},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"不过我们已经做好准备了，对吗？","id":21,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"我们已经种下了希望的种子，接下来，只需要静待它长出答案即可。","id":22,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"不要担心，就当作是一次寻常的休眠吧。除了时间要稍微漫长一点，和以往的时间旅行并无本质不同。","id":23,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#8$1","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"何况这一次，我会在你身边的。","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"我希望在跨越了寂静的永夜后，再次睁开眼时，还能第一时间看到你。","id":26,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1360_1#1$1","id":27},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"可我们的辩论依然没有得出一个答案......","id":28,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"源石是我们最后的希望，我们几乎别无他法。我们必须要明确谨慎地选择道路。","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#8$1","id":30},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"......","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":32},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":33},{"type":"text","text":"普瑞赛斯轻轻拉起了身边人的手。","id":34},{"type":"text","text":"她没有说出口的思绪，在这间思维共振室中化为有形的画面，那是一个个象征着欣喜与希望的图形。","id":35},{"type":"text","text":"她的目光诚挚，没有丝毫阴霾。","id":36},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#1$1","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"{@nickname}，我从来没有忘记我们的辩题。我们之间也不应存在任何保留。","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"看，当我们谈及属于我们的未来时，这就是我心中所想。我们应该是怀着同样的期待的。","id":39,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"嵌于我们思维中的同样的灰质销钉，也是将我们连接在一起的纽带。","id":40,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"你我的思维因此得以紧密相连，直到我们的意识随整个宇宙共同寂灭。","id":41,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#9$1","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"我们的思想交互碰撞，争论不休，却正因如此，我们才最能理解彼此的本性。","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"我很确信，对未来怀有期冀是我们的秉性，我们是彼此在这片虚无的星海中的锚点。","id":44,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1360_1#1$1","id":45},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"哪怕我们对于源石的分歧终究无法统一？我们所选择的道路终究无法共存......","id":46,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"普瑞赛斯，我不确定......","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#1$1","id":48},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"既然如此，我们就继续等待吧。","id":49,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"你现在还不愿意进入休眠，没有关系，我们还有一些时间。","id":50,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"我们可以一起阅览DWDB中保存的典籍，宇宙间也还有不少可供我们解读的死去的行星留下的诗句。","id":51,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"multiline","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"在你自己下定决心之前，我都不会强求你——","id":52},{"type":"multiline","name":"普瑞赛斯","end":"true","text":"我永远不会将自己的意志强加于你。","id":53},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#8$1","id":54},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"{@nickname}，我会等待，等到你自己做出与我站在一起的选择。","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1360_1#1$1","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"预言家","text":"普瑞赛斯......","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/54/Avg_avg_npc_1360_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#8$1","id":58},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"放轻松一点，{@nickname}，最近的观测工作让你过于疲惫了。","id":59,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"闭上眼休息一会吧，我来帮你播放一段遥远的恒星用引力弹奏的和弦，你会有一个好梦的。","id":60,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":61},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"4","id":62},{"type":"bgeffect","name":"$eb_dim_closeeye","layer":"1","id":63},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":64},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":65},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":66},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":67},{"type":"charslot","id":68},{"type":"background","id":69},{"type":"bgeffect","id":70},{"type":"sticker","id":71,"multi":"true","text":"<color=#000000>晚安，{@nickname}。</color>","x":"250","y":"300","alignment":"center","duration":"1","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"800"},{"type":"sticker","id":72,"duration":"1","block":"false"},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":73},{"type":"sticker","id":74,"multi":"true","text":"<color=#000000>直到时间的尽头，我们跨过了归于静寂的宇宙。</color>","x":"250","y":"300","alignment":"center","duration":"1","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"800"},{"type":"sticker","id":75,"multi":"true","text":"<color=#000000>\\n\\n我会在那个世界等你。</color>","block":"true"},{"type":"sticker","id":76,"duration":"2","block":"false"},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":77},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":78},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":79},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":80},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_bg_60_g13_rhodesdeck_origin.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":81},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":82},{"type":"playmusic","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act37d0d0/m_bat_wdslm_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":83,"musicid":1},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":84},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":85},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":86},{"type":"playsound","key":"$char_Mon3tr","id":87},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"npc_10002","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"（兴奋的咆哮）","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_npc_10002_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#2$1","id":90},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"......","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":92},{"type":"charslot","id":93},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_scrystalroad","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"sc","id":94},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":95},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"sc","fadetime":"2","id":96},{"type":"text","text":"Mon3tr出现在你的身前，它的姿态却稍不同于往常。","id":97},{"type":"dialog","id":98},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":99},{"type":"playsound","key":"$char_Mon3tr","id":100},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":101},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rockbreakout","volume":"1","id":102},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":103},{"type":"text","text":"不用凯尔希的命令，它以迅猛的速度向敌人飞去，可一簇源石结晶拔地而起，将黑色的怪物完全包裹其中。","id":104},{"type":"dialog","id":105},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"107","text":"凯尔希！当心——"}},"values":[],"id":106},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":107,"end":113},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#1$1","id":108},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"你很让我惊喜，AMa-10。","id":109,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"你以切断自己双生循环的系统为代价来脱离我的控制，哪怕这样会使你的生命变得脆弱不堪。","id":110,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"不过，你真的打算用这样的方式杀了我吗？","id":111,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#6$1","id":112},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"我知道，在很久之前，你的意识已经与源石中的信息海洋同化。","id":113,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6c/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-6$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":114},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_humanchange","volume":"1","id":115},{"type":"delay","time":"0.4","id":116},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":117},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":118},{"type":"background","id":119},{"type":"charslot","id":120},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":121},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/41/Avg_50_i16.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":122},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":123},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":124},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":125},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":126},{"type":"image","id":127},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0","keep":"true","id":128},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_bg_60_g13_rhodesdeck_origin.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":129},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#6$1","id":130},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"在这种情况下，真正杀死你已经是不可能的事。","id":132,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6c/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"但是特蕾西娅和特雷西斯做到的事，让我确信了一点。","id":133,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6c/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"你对源石的控制并非无可动摇，依然存在一些手段来限制你对于源石的权限。","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6c/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#1$1","id":135},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"你所说的两个人，我的确在源石内部见过他们。","id":136,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"他们的努力的确出人意料，是令人惊喜的挣扎。","id":137,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#10$1","id":138},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"所以呢？你又如何确信，在这里杀了我不是徒劳之举？","id":139,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#1$1","id":140},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"Mon3tr攻击你的时候，你选择了防御。","id":141,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#2$1","id":142},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"......","id":143,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"......你怎么能做到？","id":144,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/52/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#11$1","id":145},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"看来你已经察觉到了。","id":146,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"基于特蕾西娅对源石的研究，同样是模仿你对Dr.{@nickname}设下的陷阱，我对你所处的唤醒室加入了一些设计。","id":147,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"只要你在这里醒来，你的意识，同样会困于这具身体，而无法重新回到源石内部的信息海洋。","id":148,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e8/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#3$1","id":149},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"......？","id":150,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/9/9e/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#6$1","id":151},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"或许你迟早能突破这一层限制，而且你依然有操作源石的权限，但此刻的你，也只是一个人类。","id":152,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6c/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#7$1","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"你为了反抗我，竟然会做到这一步——","id":154,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#6$1","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"普瑞赛斯，你不是泰拉的造物主。这片大地上的一切生命，没有义务顺应你的意愿。","id":156,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6c/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#7$1","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"......这是我对你的报复，也是最后的反抗。","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/45/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":159},{"type":"text","text":"你看到站在对面的女性脸上露出了一丝犹疑，但紧接着，源石开始在她的身旁环绕。","id":160},{"type":"dialog","id":161},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"90","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":162},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_icecrystlncrse","volume":"1","id":163},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":164},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#6$1","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"......太迟了。","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6c/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":167},{"type":"charslot","id":168},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"170","text":"阿米娅！帮助凯尔希！"}},"values":[],"id":169},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":170,"end":197},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_amiya_atk_01","layer":"1","id":171},{"type":"playsound","key":"$p_skill_chimera","volume":"1","id":172},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":173},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.8","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":174},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.8","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":175},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.8","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":176},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.4","block":"true","id":177},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":178},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_phntsmbrek","volume":"1","id":179},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_phntsmglsbrek","volume":"1","id":180},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.8","xstrength":"50","ystrength":"50","vibrato":"90","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":181},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":182},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.03","block":"true","id":183},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":184},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":185},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.5","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":186},{"type":"playsound","key":"$char_Mon3tr","id":187},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"npc_10002","id":188},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mon3tr","text":"（激昂的咆哮）","id":189,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5c/Avg_npc_10002_1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#6$3","id":190},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"凯尔希医生......这一次换我来保护您......","id":191,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/a6/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-6$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":192},{"type":"text","text":"黑色的法术乱流击碎了源石晶簇，Mon3tr挣脱而出，继续向唯一的目标袭去。","id":193},{"type":"text","text":"源石晶簇重新开始聚集，却已经来不及构成足以抵挡Mon3tr爪锋的屏障。","id":194},{"type":"text","text":"你看到了普瑞赛斯紧张的神情，造物主面对她的造物流露出了恐惧。","id":195},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#7$1","id":196},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"......！","id":197,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-7$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":198},{"type":"charslot","id":199},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_surfacefrozen","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"sur","id":200},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":201},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"sur","fadetime":"6","id":202},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drkcludsthdr","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"d","id":203},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"d","fadetime":"2","id":204},{"type":"text","text":"似乎是普瑞赛斯终于认同了她此时面临着威胁，整片甲板上的源石都开始回应她的意识而急剧滋长。","id":205},{"type":"text","text":"Mon3tr已经逼近了它的猎物。","id":206},{"type":"dialog","id":207},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"d","fadetime":"2","id":208},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":209},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":210},{"type":"charslot","id":211},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/22/Avg_bg_60_g15_rhodesabyss_off.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":212},{"type":"playsound","key":"$swordtsing4","id":213},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_slash_01_l","x":"68.2","y":"13.3","rox":"73.1","roy":"5.6","roz":"-75.4","layer":"1","id":214},{"type":"delay","time":"0.8","id":215},{"type":"playsound","key":"$swordtsing5","id":216},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_slash_01_l","x":"-86.9","y":"-27.5","rox":"-74.9","roy":"-15.2","roz":"118.3","layer":"2","id":217},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":218},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":219},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_521_1#1$1","id":220},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Mechanist","text":"右侧五名，确认瘫痪。","id":221,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/d/db/Avg_avg_npc_521_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4133_logos_1#1$1","id":222},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Logos","text":"“殁亡”。","id":223,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/45/Avg_avg_4133_logos_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":224},{"type":"charslot","id":225},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_boneflute_low","volume":"1","id":226},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":227},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.5","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1.5","block":"true","id":228},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":229},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_017_huang_1#4$2","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"看上去神神道道的，结果不还是把那些我们已经打败过一次的敌人再拉出来一遍嘛，没什么大不了的。","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_017_huang_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_017_huang_1#5$2","id":232},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"再吃我这招——","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0e/Avg_avg_017_huang_1-5$2.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":234},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovement","id":235},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,40","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.3","id":236},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":237},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":238},{"type":"charslot","id":239},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":240},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1727_1#1$1","id":241},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1728_1#1$1","id":242},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":243},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":244},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"40","ystrength":"40","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":245},{"type":"playsound","key":"$e_atk_saw_n_2","volume":"1","id":246},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.03","block":"true","id":247},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":248},{"type":"playsound","key":"$e_atk_saw_n_1","volume":"1","id":249},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"40","ystrength":"40","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":250},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_explo_n","id":251},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":252},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":253},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":254},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":255},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":256},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_shdwblwvr","volume":"1","id":257},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":258},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":259},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_017_huang_1#4$2","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"是我的错觉吗？这里原地产生敌人的速度好像变慢了？","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/c0/Avg_avg_017_huang_1-4$2.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1730_1#3$1","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Raidian","text":"这里是PRTS的核心系统，从一开始，它就是在读取我们以往面对过的敌人的数据并复制出来。","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_npc_1730_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Raidian","text":"但是现在它读取资料库数据的速度变慢了，似乎是受到了一些阻碍......","id":264,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_npc_1730_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"Raidian","text":"看来是博士那边的行动奏效了。","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/12/Avg_avg_npc_1730_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_4132_ascln_1#4$1","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿斯卡纶","text":"抓紧这个机会，一举攻破它。","id":267,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_avg_4132_ascln_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿斯卡纶","text":"我们要到Abyss深处去......还有人在等着我们。","id":268,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_avg_4132_ascln_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":269},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"3","id":270},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":271},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":272},{"type":"charslot","id":273},{"type":"background","id":274},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"Mon3tr，熔毁。","id":275},{"type":"dialog","id":276},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":277},{"type":"playsound","key":"$p_skill_chimera","volume":"1","id":278},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":279},{"type":"playsound","key":"$b_char_fireharm","volume":"1","id":280},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":281},{"type":"playsound","key":"$b_char_fireharm","volume":"1","id":282},{"type":"delay","time":"0.3","id":283},{"type":"playsound","key":"$b_char_fireharm","volume":"1","id":284},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_explo_n","id":285},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":286},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":287},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":288},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":289},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":290},{"type":"text","text":"黑色的法术和激光轮番射向前方庞杂的源石晶簇，这样猛烈的攻势甚至压制住了源石扩张的态势。","id":291},{"type":"text","text":"直到法术的光芒淹没了普瑞赛斯的身形。","id":292},{"type":"dialog","id":293},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"false","id":294},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_sand_transition","layer":"3","id":295},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_sand_lp","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"sa","id":296},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":297},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3e/Avg_bg_60_g13_rhodesdeck_origin.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":298},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"sa","fadetime":"2","id":299},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":300},{"type":"text","text":"烟尘散去后，只剩下一地的源石碎屑。","id":301},{"type":"text","text":"还有一件残破的白色外套。","id":302},{"type":"dialog","id":303},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"305","text":"我们......打败她了吗？"}},"values":[],"id":304},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":305,"end":315},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#3$1","id":306},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"......","id":307,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e6/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#1$3","id":308},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"我感受不到......任何生命的迹象，感受不到任何情绪......","id":309,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"或许......","id":310,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/c/cb/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-1$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":311},{"type":"text","text":"情况发生得太突然，你对眼前的一系列变故都还没来得及有些实感。","id":312},{"type":"text","text":"你亲眼目睹了那个极具威胁的敌人在你面前灰飞烟灭。","id":313},{"type":"text","text":"可你没有任何松了一口气的感觉。","id":314},{"type":"dialogue","name":"？？？","text":"玩闹可以到此为止吗？","id":315,"end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":316},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_act1mainss_bat1_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act1mainss/m_act1mainss_bat1_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":317,"musicid":2},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drkcludsthdr","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"d","id":318},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"d","fadetime":"2","id":319},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","id":320},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#1$1","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":321},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":322},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":323},{"type":"decision","options":{"1":{"id":"325","text":"怎么回事......！"}},"values":[],"id":324},{"type":"predicate","references":["1"],"id":325,"end":342},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#5$3","id":326},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"这怎么会——","id":327,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e0/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-5$3.png"},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":328},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#7$1","id":329},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"博士、阿米娅，后退！","id":330,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/45/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#1$1","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"有力的反抗，AMa-10，你的计划奏效了。","id":332,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"诚如你所说，现在你们的确有杀死我的机会......","id":333,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/b/b2/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#10$1","id":334},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"可是，只是一个用源石塑造出的替身，就会让你如此慌张吗？","id":335,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#6$1","id":336},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"......！","id":337,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6c/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#10$1","id":338},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"AMa-10，我无意与你辩论你信奉的价值。","id":339,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"你一直以来所坚持的事，它们太渺小，我甚至无法找到一种可信的逻辑架构来评价它们的意义。","id":340,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"可是实验中的确会出现这样的情况，一些细小的误差，最终造成了巨大的妨碍。我不得不接受这样的结果。","id":341,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"我很遗憾，要将你当作这个误差来抹除。","id":342,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/50/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-10$1.png","end":true},{"type":"dialog","id":343},{"type":"charslot","id":344},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_crystalrise","volume":"1","id":345},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_erthshkng","volume":"0.4","loop":"true","channel":"e","id":346},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"4","xstrength":"10","ystrength":"10","vibrato":"90","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":347},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"e","fadetime":"6","id":348},{"type":"delay","time":"4","id":349},{"type":"text","text":"普瑞赛斯抬起了手。","id":350},{"type":"text","text":"源石再次开始生长，结晶构成的尖锐的枝桠在你与阿米娅的身边密集地围绕起来，顷刻间便要将你们吞没。","id":351},{"type":"text","text":"阿米娅拼尽全力用法术击碎周遭的源石，可晶簇生长的速度远为迅捷。","id":352},{"type":"dialog","id":353},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1037_amiya3_1#4$3","id":354},{"type":"dialogue","name":"阿米娅","text":"博士！躲在我身后——","id":355,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/e/e1/Avg_avg_1037_amiya3_1-4$3.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#4$1","id":356},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"——！","id":357,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/10/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":358},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_003_kalts_1#7$1","id":359},{"type":"dialogue","name":"凯尔希","text":"Mon3tr——","id":360,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/4/45/Avg_avg_003_kalts_1-7$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":361},{"type":"charslot","id":362},{"type":"effect","name":"$e_amiya_atk_01","layer":"1","id":363},{"type":"playsound","key":"$p_skill_chimera","volume":"1","id":364},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":365},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.8","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":366},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.8","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":367},{"type":"blocker","a":"0.8","r":"1","g":"1","b":"1","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":368},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.4","block":"true","id":369},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":370},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"1","xstrength":"40","ystrength":"40","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":371},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_explo_n","id":372},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":373},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":374},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":375},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.05","block":"true","id":376},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"1","block":"true","id":377},{"type":"text","text":"这一切都在电光石火间发生。","id":378},{"type":"text","text":"你看到源石晶簇在与你近在咫尺的地方炸裂，阿米娅想要保护你，可时间不允许她作出任何反应。","id":379},{"type":"text","text":"你看到黑色怪物在这一瞬间来到了你和阿米娅的身边，用庞大且坚实的身躯挡在了你们与源石晶簇之间。","id":380},{"type":"text","text":"你看到了凯尔希......","id":381},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1718_1#8$1","id":382},{"type":"dialogue","name":"普瑞赛斯","text":"可惜。","id":383,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/f/f7/Avg_avg_npc_1718_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":384},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"d","fadetime":"1","id":385},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1","id":386},{"type":"charslot","duration":"1.5","id":387},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"6","xstrength":"5","ystrength":"5","vibrato":"90","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":388},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_scrystalroad","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"sc","id":389},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":390},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"sc","fadetime":"0.5","id":391},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_phntsmbrek","volume":"1","id":392},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_phntsmglsbrek","volume":"1","id":393},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":394},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":395},{"type":"background","id":396},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":397},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":398},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":399},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":400},{"type":"background","id":401},{"type":"cameraeffect","effect":"Grayscale","amount":"0.8","keep":"true","id":402},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_ac8mi_melancholic_kalts.png","screenadapt":"coverall","xScale":"1.1","yScale":"1.1","id":403},{"type":"imagetween","xFrom":"50","xTo":"-50","duration":"20","block":"false","id":404},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowstormflp","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"sn","id":405},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"sn","fadetime":"2","id":406},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":407},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"4","block":"false","id":408},{"type":"text","text":"你会质疑自己存在的意义吗，博士？我会。","id":409},{"type":"text","text":"我很清楚自己的使命，尽管艰难，但我认同它的意义。","id":410},{"type":"text","text":"关于未来，你会有自己的答案，我只能这样坚持。","id":411},{"type":"text","text":"不用太担心我的事情，罗德岛不应当脆弱到离开了某人就无法前行。","id":412},{"type":"dialog","id":413},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":414},{"type":"text","text":"我的愿望？","id":415},{"type":"text","text":"我的愿望就是守护好你和阿米娅的愿望。","id":416},{"type":"text","text":"我立下的誓言我永远不会背弃。尽管我们对守护的定义各不相同，但我会站在这里，直到最后。","id":417},{"type":"text","text":"我们无法忘怀过去，但你会有不一样的未来。","id":418},{"type":"dialog","id":419},{"type":"image","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/a/ae/Avg_avg_ac8mi_sidebyside_dusk.png","screenadapt":"coverall","fadetime":"2","id":420},{"type":"imagetween","xScaleFrom":"1.05","yScaleFrom":"1.05","xScaleTo":"1","yScaleTo":"1","duration":"10","block":"false","id":421},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":422},{"type":"text","text":"我已经寻找到了自己生命的意义。","id":423},{"type":"text","text":"请带领罗德岛......","id":424},{"type":"text","text":"继续走下去吧。","id":425},{"type":"text","text":"{@nickname}。","id":426},{"type":"dialog","id":427},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"sn","fadetime":"2","id":428},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.2","fadetime":"3","id":429},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$m_sys_act1mainss_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act1mainss/m_sys_act1mainss_loop.mp3","volume":"0","id":430,"musicid":3},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"4","id":431},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"3","block":"true","id":432},{"type":"image","id":433},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":434},{"type":"subtitle","text":"不知不觉，我好像已经习惯了有人在我身边来帮助我、引导我。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":435},{"type":"subtitle","text":"直到现在，我终于可以确定自己要做的事情。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":436},{"type":"subtitle","text":"无论怎样，这条路我会继续走下去。我不会放弃希望。","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":437},{"type":"subtitle","text":"可是......","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":438},{"type":"subtitle","text":"......你呢？","x":"300","y":"350","alignment":"center","size":"24","delay":"0.04","width":"700","id":439},{"type":"subtitle","id":440},{"type":"musicvolume","volume":"0.6","fadetime":"2","id":44